  {
   "id": "dr-atominus-142807@2.3.0",
   "gameId": "dr-atominus-142807",
   "displayName": "Update 2.3.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-05-18T16:33:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Dr. Atominus Version 2.3.0",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dr. Atominus was just updated! In this update, some graphics were improved and there were also some other small improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improved some graphics",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The sprites / images of 2 bosses have been improved a little. First, the infamously ugly spider.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "After",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Also, the true last boss. But I’m not putting the image here because of spoilers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In the settings, when changing the language, it will now always show the word \"language\" in English too, so the option is easier to find when accidentally changing the language",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game engine and other software was updated. Thanks to that, the download size of the game is a little smaller. The file size never was large, but even a little helps people with not much free space.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all. I hope this update will improve the overall quality of the game. :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
